"Years later, the Continuance Charter passes at the great Conclave with Nathan's upload."
"The Charter replaces Endings with non-destructive events that bring new magics."
"The Charter seeks spontaneous dungeons, blights with agency and a monster ecology."
"The Charter sets rules for wars and civilian zones immune to mass spells."
"The Charter bans mind magics, contract magics and mass social skills."
"Years later, the Continuance Council, an alliance of many countries, is built on the Charter."
"The Council's first full meeting is set at the Arena of the Concord."
"Colborn is a true power behind the Council nine years on."
"Nine years on, the Council defends Dawn's Concord from the Severance Bloc and wins."
"Davrar's injunction blocks city-killing magic in that battle."
